
/**
 * SprintAssistant — floating chat button + overlay chat window.
 *
 * Features:
 *  • Floating action button (bottom-right, above all other UI)
 *  • Draggable chat window
 *  • Voice input via Web Speech API
 *  • Real RAG responses generated by the backend (ChromaDB + Gemini)
 *  • Export conversation as .txt
 *  • Markdown-lite formatting (bold, italic)
 *  • Suggested questions
 *
 * IMPORTANT:
 * Conversation history is NOT sent to the backend.
 * Each question is independent.
 */

